    [5274]={name="Rose Mantle",quality=2,ilvl=27,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Morganth'.",zone="Redridge Mountains",questName="Morganth",lore="After much observation, I have discovered Morganth's plans. He searches for the Scythe of Elune...and he may have found it! If he has, then the Redridge Mountains, and the kingdom of Stormwind, will soon feel his dark might."},
    [5275]={name="Binding Girdle",quality=2,ilvl=15,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Disruption Ends'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="The Barrens",questName="The Disruption Ends",lore="One of my scouts witnessed an attack on a caravan from Durotar. The culprits are indeed the Razormane tribe of quilboars. One of the quilboars in particular is leading the raids: Kreenig Snarlsnout."},
    [5313]={name="Totemic Clan Ring",quality=2,ilvl=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Revenge of Gann'.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Revenge of Gann",lore="Following Khazgorm's plans it should be no problem to fashion an explosive charge Ah, there we go. Now, I am going to entrust you with a special task."},
    [5317]={name="Dry Moss Tunic",quality=2,ilvl=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Betrayal from Within'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Betrayal from Within",lore="Take Lok's head to Thork in the Crossroads. He should know what has happened to my tribe without any words--ha, not that he would believe Mangletooth helped in such things."},
    [5319]={name="Bashing Pauldrons",quality=1,ilvl=20,reqLevel=15,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Haren Swifthoof (rare elite).",zone="The Loch",npc="Haren Swifthoof"},
    [5327]={name="Greasy Tinker's Pants",quality=2,ilvl=18,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Escape'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="The Barrens",questName="The Escape",lore="I suppose I'll learn as we go... Couldn't be too hard. Just some buttons here, and a lever or two... Well, are you ready to go?"},
    [5340]={name="Cauldron Stirrer",quality=2,ilvl=15,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Apothecary Zamah'.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Apothecary Zamah",lore="I have rendered the spores you gave me into an emulsion. I must now send it to my associate, Apothecary Zamah. If you were to carry this to her, she can offer you something from our stores of alchemical goods."},
    [5343]={name="Barkeeper's Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=18,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Raptor Horns'.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Raptor Horns",lore="The raptors of the Barrens are smarter than raptors in other lands. And I think all that smarts is hiding in their horns!"},
    [5351]={name="Bounty Hunter's Ring",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hezrul Bloodmark'.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Hezrul Bloodmark",lore="Hezrul Bloodmark is the leader of the Kolkar centaurs in the Barrens. He is fierce, brutal and cunning. Defeating him would disrupt and fracture the Kolkars, greatly reducing their threat to us."},
